{"id":"606a5b41818fa845","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family.md","title":"ZFC Measure11 Measurable Subset Family","display":"df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family — ZFC Measure11 Measurable Subset Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family"],"display":"df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family — ZFC Measure11 Measurable Subset Family","depends_on":["[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family — ZFC Measure11 Measurable Subset Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (candidate measurable family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableSubsetFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableSubsetFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSubsetFamily}_S(\\Sigma,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSubsetFamily}_S(\\Sigma,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A family of measurable subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is precisely a sigma-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; the powerset condition makes the ambient complement explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurableSubsetFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSubsetFamily}_S(\\Sigma,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1015,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2559","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family.md|58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-subset-family]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["a740bdad87b97ac6"]}